{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and sell your unique succulent bonsai.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can grow a complete succulent using succulent leaves. When the succulent is in the state of flower sword, it is possible to generate a new variety of succulents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/12fc39906556a8989c99f6b0e2f7eba4.poster.avif?t=1769701918\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/12fc39906556a8989c99f6b0e2f7eba4.webm?t=1769701918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/12fc39906556a8989c99f6b0e2f7eba4.mp4?t=1769701918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use flower pots, succulents and ornaments to create your personalized bonsai. There are a wealth of materials to match here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/ebe08d8da9abb216633047b3d66e3cb2.poster.avif?t=1769701918\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/ebe08d8da9abb216633047b3d66e3cb2.webm?t=1769701918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/ebe08d8da9abb216633047b3d66e3cb2.mp4?t=1769701918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to every customer's story and pack and send them the most suitable succulent bonsai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/d1d6baebed63d8e1446eb6c863eaa774.poster.avif?t=1769701918\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/d1d6baebed63d8e1446eb6c863eaa774.webm?t=1769701918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/d1d6baebed63d8e1446eb6c863eaa774.mp4?t=1769701918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has no big goals and no winning or losing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The probability of items appearing is relatively high, so there will not be too much pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just calm down and feel the joy of creation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like simple planting and creation, give it a try (Add to your wishlist !)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1664520?t=1769701918","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/004aea37dc7b7e6e145d50ea7731daaff404baae/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769701918","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/453c3a4b40b93aa50d5c4daedda5617b772d3435/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769701918","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/453c3a4b40b93aa50d5c4daedda5617b772d3435/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769701918","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4369240,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and sell your unique succulent bonsai.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can grow a complete succulent using succulent leaves. When the succulent is in the state of flower sword, it is possible to generate a new variety of succulents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/12fc39906556a8989c99f6b0e2f7eba4.poster.avif?t=1769701918\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/12fc39906556a8989c99f6b0e2f7eba4.webm?t=1769701918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/12fc39906556a8989c99f6b0e2f7eba4.mp4?t=1769701918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use flower pots, succulents and ornaments to create your personalized bonsai. There are a wealth of materials to match here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/ebe08d8da9abb216633047b3d66e3cb2.poster.avif?t=1769701918\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/ebe08d8da9abb216633047b3d66e3cb2.webm?t=1769701918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/ebe08d8da9abb216633047b3d66e3cb2.mp4?t=1769701918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to every customer's story and pack and send them the most suitable succulent bonsai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/d1d6baebed63d8e1446eb6c863eaa774.poster.avif?t=1769701918\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/d1d6baebed63d8e1446eb6c863eaa774.webm?t=1769701918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/d1d6baebed63d8e1446eb6c863eaa774.mp4?t=1769701918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has no big goals and no winning or losing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The probability of items appearing is relatively high, so there will not be too much pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just calm down and feel the joy of creation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like simple planting and creation, give it a try (Add to your wishlist !)</p>","developers":["Ergou Li"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/35064036c92ef887c301d59b9b45be48d5b643b5/header.jpg?t=1769701918","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Ergou Li Game. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1664520/804631884/6504bb9eec3123af10d8293